## Planner prompt addendum

When `Phase: plan`, the rendered prompt must include this requirement:

```text
Include a section titled "KHS Checklist Seed" with unchecked markdown tasks. Each task must include phase, expected evidence artifact, and verification/check condition. Do not start implementation.
```

KHS will parse and normalize that seed into `checklist.md`; the backend's seed is not the final checklist.

